  (text "I2C BUS — 400kHz Fast Mode\n\nAddress Map:\n  0x76 — BME280 (SDO=GND)\n  0x36 — AS5600\n  0x60 — SI1145\n  0x23 — BH1750 (ADDR=GND)\n\n4.7k pull-ups to 3V3 on SDA & SCL\nMax bus capacitance: ~400pF\nKeep I2C traces < 30cm total"
    (at 50.8 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "WIND SPEED / RAIN GAUGE PROTECTION:\n\n- 10k pull-up to 3V3 (open-collector/reed switch)\n- 100nF debounce cap to GND\n- Add BAT54S clamping diodes (not shown)\n  to protect GPIO from voltage spikes\n- Reed switch contacts rated >10M cycles"
    (at 280.67 130.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "AS5600 WIND VANE NOTES:\n\n- Requires 6mm dia. x 2.5mm diametrically\n  magnetized neodymium magnet on vane shaft\n- Mount AS5600 PCB directly below magnet,\n  0.5mm-3mm air gap\n- DIR pin tied to GND = clockwise direction\n- OUT pin unused (I2C mode only)"
    (at 175.26 130.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
  )

